{"version":1,"content":"<p>天文台周一（26日）表示，預料一股清勁至強風程度東北季候風補充會在周二（27日）晚抵達廣東沿岸，周二晚本港東風增強，周三至周四初時本港風勢較大。</p><p>預料另一股東北季候風會在下周初至中期影響華南。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T11:40:56.525173+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":96,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T11:01:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T12:38:11.467391+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T11:38:08.820723+00:00","content_hash":"95ad76ad6d859a5be96f578f73ba69a33c4d58e43680e6893761f4660c93e98c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}